         <name>Cereals</name>
         <description>A cereal refers to any grass plant grown for its edible grains (seeds), which are a staple food source.  Cereals grow in Akkar, North Lebanon, and other areas. The term also applies to the grains themselves, which are rich in carbohydrates. Usually, cereals in Lebanon consists of wheat, barley, and corn </description>
